  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The Palms offers breathtaking ocean views and just steps to the beach! It is located BEACHSIDE with deeded beach access and just one house back from the water. Only 20 steps and your toes are in the white sugar sand of the Gulf of Mexico. Private beach access with no stairs! <br><br>You will surely enjoy your time at The Palms, many have! This year we added to the fun, with a new private pool. The pool is for the guests of The Palms only. Bring your family and friends and take a dip in the new \"private\" heated/cooled salt water pool. Relax on the deck with family and friends and watch the dolphins, ocean white caps and the spectacular sunsets. Have fun in the rec area, which features a Ping-Pong table, large 65 inch TV and board games. <br><br>This home has been totally remodeled inside and out. Including all new furniture, flooring, new HD Smart televisions, bedding/linens and décor. The top floor of this home has an open concept kitchen, living and dining room. The dining area includes seating for eight (8) and a breakfast bar that seat five (5). <br> <br>Boasting en-suite bedrooms, The Palms sleeps 8-10 people with three King master suites and a bunkroom. Walk out the master bedroom to a full-length upper deck and enjoy a morning cup of coffee or an evening glass of wine. The master bathroom has double sinks, separate shower and a jetted tub. The bunkroom has full size beds and a full size sleeper sofa. If baby comes along, this home is furnished with a pack and play and high chair. <br><br>You will enjoy the convenient location of Inlet Beach without the crowded beaches. Located nearby are restaurants, shopping, biking, fishing, paddle boarding. This house is just minutes from Rosemary Beach and Camp Helen State Park and a 15 minute drive to Pier Park shopping and entertainment hub.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Inlet Beach, Private Heated Pool, Beachfront, Daily Beach Chair Service"
        }
      ],
